Z||000000||Fiero5||11-09-2000||08:18 PM||||We currently have two beautiful, friendly and playfull Ferret's. We have had Ferret's for many, many years. My daughter Tarrah and I are also starting up a Ferret newsletter.<BR>Anyone on the forum who has or had Ferrets, or just likes them in general please let us know.<BR>If you would like a copy of our upcoming first ferret issue also let us know :o)<P>Fiero5, Fiero2 and Family<P>------------------<BR>                                                                                                                                                             <IMG SRC="http://web.missouri.edu/~rrc961/pix/fos.a.jpg"> ||||reg||1
